## ❌ What NOT to Test with Navigateur MCP

1. **❌ Form Validation Logic** - Use Jest (pure logic, no browser needed)
2. **❌ Button Click Handlers** - Use React Testing Library (DOM events work in jsdom)
3. **❌ State Management** - Use Jest (state logic doesn't need browser)
4. **❌ Utility Functions** - Use Jest (pure functions are fastest with Jest)
5. **❌ Component Rendering** - Use React Testing Library (jsdom handles rendering fine)

